품질을 자랑한다.","updated":"2026-06-30","facilities":[{"k":"주요시설","v":"일반야영장(11면)","items":["일반야영장(11면)"]},{"k":"기타 정보","v":"개인 트레일러 입장가능","items":["개인 트레일러 입장가능"]},{"k":"기타 부대시설","v":"모래놀이터","items":["모래놀이터"]},{"k":"사이트 간격","v":"3M"},{"k":"바닥형태 (단위:면)","v":"잔디 (2) · 파쇄석 (6) · 테크 (3)","items":["잔디 (2)","파쇄석 (6)","테크 (3)"]},{"k":"사이트 크기","v":"6 X 6 : 11개"},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"캠핑장 문의","items":["캠핑장 문의"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"불가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"},{"k":"안전시설현황","v":"소화기 (7) · 방화사 (1)","items":["소화기 (7)","방화사 (1)"]}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/3280DkNnNQ6wVvwJ9i13JCxQ.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/8647WSFwDZ2IjqUaZCBvf72N.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/3389Aqu68ZYCe9fReOw6rIqD.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/1582z587Yj3P5M9Qnc7ududG.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/5450TyL1nQdwCnKNGMqLCF87.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/5748zvIO4asjHOHm2xkacOsf.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/07037ZvbI86i1yo5erLk9Q16.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/3608l5QltTVE1SJiWac8Qz9m.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/1497soHJbSyaVqInvEvHS6l4.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/7226bLgqd1FaJBe0TcPLxA9W.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/2162ZVDvOkMd469TSi2MQ0Uq.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/7890P9BoES3Pdn1a3pThy04s.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/2700UwN7HWI8a2DCRppNA8OE.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/5872sSiY79I1LSlsy1BDlDA0.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/5225cC4HrdVj2nKyZjG2LJ9S.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/1120KU7i2JHJqUR03yOnAb7X.jpg"],"layout":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/1941/2018RiarJezhNLpfiSWSE0nN.jpg"],"checked_at":"2026-10-20T03:16:26.622Z"}}